WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:19.637
Vidiyoyi ikusonyeza zifukwa zosiyanasiyana zochepetsera kuona kwa anthu amene ali ndi shuga.

00:00:19.637 --> 00:00:39.275
M'chitsanzo chimodzi kuwala kobwerera kwa maso awiri kukusiyana.

00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:58.912
Mutu ukusonyeza kupatuka kwa retina chifukwa chokokedwa ndi minofu yogwirizana ndi mitsempha yatsopano.

00:00:58.912 --> 00:01:18.550
Chithunzi chomaliza chikusonyeza kusawonekera bwino kutsogolo kwa diso.
